# MCP Generator — Specification (v1)

## Overview

MCP Generator is a **Bun + TypeScript** CLI application that generates production-ready **Model Context Protocol (MCP)** servers from existing **OpenAPI Specifications**.

Instead of manually implementing MCP tools for every REST endpoint, the generator automatically parses an OpenAPI specification, converts it into an internal representation, generates a complete TypeScript MCP project using the official MCP TypeScript SDK, validates the generated project, and outputs a runnable MCP server.

The project follows a compiler-style architecture:

```
OpenAPI Specification
        │
        ▼
OpenAPI Parser
        │
        ▼
Internal Intermediate Model
        │
        ▼
Code Generator
        │
        ▼
Generated TypeScript Project
        │
        ▼
Official MCP SDK
        │
        ▼
Runnable MCP Server
```

The generator is deterministic, meaning the same OpenAPI specification always produces the same MCP server.

