- Support JSON and YAML specifications
- Resolve nested `$ref` definitions
- Support GET endpoints
- Support POST endpoints
- Support PUT endpoints
- Support PATCH endpoints
- Support DELETE endpoints
- Parse path parameters
- Parse query parameters
- Parse request bodies
- Parse response schemas
- Parse authentication schemes
- Generate Zod schemas
- Generate one MCP tool for every endpoint
- Generate authentication layer
- Generate complete Bun project
- Generate TypeScript source code using ts-morph
- Generate project assets using Handlebars
- Format generated source code
- Build generated project automatically
- Validate generated MCP server
- Verify MCP initialization
- Verify generated tools
- Produce a production-ready runnable MCP server
